    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But isn't that just a way to justify imperialism? Doesn't prioritizing one country's version of \"democracy\" over another nation's sovereignty violate the fundamental principle of international law? Explain why the R2P doctrine should take precedence over a state's right to self-determination.",
